5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a joy to be with you all. Let us seek a project that is not only brilliant in vision but sustainable in its human requirements.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited! I want to make sure the researchers actually have enough money for their stuff, so I'll be looking at the costs!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should be careful. I want to see if our past choices actually worked out the way we hoped they would.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Let's get straight to it. I'm tired of projects getting stuck for reasons that have nothing to do with the science. I'll find the bottlenecks.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Takumi. We must ensure the shared infrastructure can actually handle another project without collapsing. I will investigate the facility status.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,A wise start. I shall look into the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength to see who is available.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm going to check the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I will examine the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'll check the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the station records from partner field sites.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will look into the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
